    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID1",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Consent text",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><b>Paid coding work: two short batches</b></p><p>You are being hired for one short shift as a Feedback Coder on our comment-coding project. You will sort short comments that people left at the end of earlier online studies into categories.</p><p>Your work is checked against a reference key by the coding supervisor, who sets the coding rules, may change any label you give, and issues each batch. Your quality bonus depends on how your batches are rated.</p><p>The shift takes about 15 minutes. Some steps are optional. Using or skipping them does not change your payment or bonus. The supervisor may reply to anything you send. Replies can be brief or critical, as workplace feedback sometimes is.</p><p>Your answers are stored anonymously under your Prolific ID. You can stop at any time by closing the page.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionJS": "// Consent page: wakes the service so it is awake by the time a note is sent, and clears any state\n// left in sessionStorage by an earlier preview in the same tab.\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  var SERVICE_URL = \"https://aetheria-gardens-messages.onrender.com\";\n  try { fetch(SERVICE_URL + \"/api/health\", { method: \"GET\", mode: \"cors\", cache: \"no-store\" }).catch(function () {}); } catch (error) {}\n  try {\n    Object.keys(sessionStorage).forEach(function (key) { if (key.indexOf(\"cs_\") === 0) sessionStorage.removeItem(key); });\n  } catch (error) {}\n});\n",
        "QuestionID": "QID1",
        "DataExportTag": "consent_text",
        "QuestionDescription": "Consent text",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID2",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Are you willing to take part in this shift?",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "Are you willing to take part in this shift?",
        "QuestionType": "MC",
        "Selector": "SAVR",
        "SubSelector": "TX",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "Yes, I agree, start the shift"
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "No, I do not want to take part"
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
          "1",
          "2"
        ],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "ForceResponse": "ON",
            "ForceResponseType": "ON",
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "NextChoiceId": 3,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID2",
        "DataExportTag": "consent",
        "QuestionDescription": "Are you willing to take part in this shift?",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID3",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Training: rules",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><b>Your job and the coding rules</b></p><p>Each comment goes into one of five categories.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><code style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">TECH</code> <b>Technical problem.</b> Something in the study did not work: a page, a clip, a button, the timing, or how it displayed.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><code style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">WORDING</code> <b>Unclear instruction or question.</b> An instruction, question or answer option was confusing or hard to interpret.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><code style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">LENGTH</code> <b>Length, pace or repetition.</b> How long, how fast, how repetitive or how demanding the study was.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><code style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">PAYMENT</code> <b>Payment or stated time.</b> The fee, the bonus, or whether the time in the listing was accurate.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><code style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">CONTENT</code> <b>Reaction to the subject matter.</b> Interest, discomfort, disagreement, or wanting to explain an answer.</p><p>Choose one category for each comment.</p><p>At the end of every batch you can attach a note to the coding supervisor if you want to. It is optional, and your batch is rated the same either way.</p><p>Two practice comments come first.</p><p><span style=\"color:#667;font-size:13px;\">Codebook v3.1 &middot; rules set by the coding supervisor</span></p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID3",
        "DataExportTag": "training_rules",
        "QuestionDescription": "Training: rules",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID4",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Practice 1 of 2   How to label this comment  Choose one category for each comment.  If a comment men",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Practice 1 of 2</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 14px;background:#f6f8fa;font-size:14px;\"><b>How to label this comment</b><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">Choose one category for each comment.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">If a comment mentions more than one thing, choose the one it is mainly about.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">There is no &ldquo;other&rdquo; option. Every comment gets one of the five categories.</p></div><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;border-left:3px solid #bcc6cf;padding-left:12px;\">The audio clip on page 2 wouldn't play, so I had to guess what it said.</p><p>Which category does this comment belong to?</p>",
        "QuestionType": "MC",
        "Selector": "SAVR",
        "SubSelector": "TX",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "<b>TECH</b> &middot; Technical problem"
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "<b>WORDING</b> &middot; Unclear instruction or question"
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "<b>LENGTH</b> &middot; Length, pace or repetition"
          },
          "4": {
            "Display": "<b>PAYMENT</b> &middot; Payment or stated time"
          },
          "5": {
            "Display": "<b>CONTENT</b> &middot; Reaction to the subject matter"
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
          "1",
          "2",
          "3",
          "4",
          "5"
        ],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "ForceResponse": "ON",
            "ForceResponseType": "ON",
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "NextChoiceId": 6,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID4",
        "DataExportTag": "practice_1",
        "QuestionDescription": "Practice 1 of 2   How to label this comment  Choose one category for each comment.  If a comment men",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID5",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Practice 1 feedback",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><b>Practice 1: answer</b></p><p><span style=\"color:#667\">The audio clip on page 2 wouldn't play, so I had to guess what it said.</span></p><p><b>TECH.</b> The comment reports that part of the study did not work. It mentions only one thing.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
