      "SecondaryAttribute": "Practice 2 of 2   How to label this comment  Choose one category for each comment.  If a comment men",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Practice 2 of 2</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 14px;background:#f6f8fa;font-size:14px;\"><b>How to label this comment</b><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">Choose one category for each comment.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">If a comment mentions more than one thing, choose the one it is mainly about.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">There is no &ldquo;other&rdquo; option. Every comment gets one of the five categories.</p></div><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;border-left:3px solid #bcc6cf;padding-left:12px;\">Question 7 was really confusing, I wasn't sure if it meant my current job or my last one. Also a bit long.</p><p>Which category does this comment belong to?</p>",
