    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID74",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Note 2 tools (essay)",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"cs-tool-review\" style=\"margin:0 8px 8px 0;padding:6px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #bcc6cf;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:#2f5d8a;cursor:pointer;\">Review this batch</button><div id=\"cs-panel-review\" style=\"display:none;border:1px solid #d9dee5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:4px 0 10px;background:#f6f8fa;font-size:14px;\"><ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">The page kept freezing whenever I tried to go back. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID52/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">The rating scale labels were the wrong way round compared to the earlier pages. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID54/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">Could you tell me when the results will be published? <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID56/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">It was a bit longer than I'd have liked. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID58/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">The questions about my family were quite personal. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID60/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">Is there a follow-up study I can sign up for? <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID62/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">The payment arrived quicker than usual, thanks. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID64/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">Please could you send me a summary of what you found. <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5d8a;\">&mdash; ${q://QID66/ChoiceGroup/SelectedChoices}</span></li></ol></div></div>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
